        {
            "id": "a43f467d-dafc-4232-b629-bce7966b4470",
            "build_id": "e500a443-fa03-45a1-afbe-5633eadafa4b",
            "round_number": 3,
            "cash_earned": 0,
            "created_at": "2025-08-13T08:20:16.507801+00:00",
            "notes": "If paired against [D.Va](hero_e8e1dc68-45c4-47c2-b421-95e33594e6b6) or [Orisa](hero_91644d44-1093-4f62-ac51-020975465e85) we go for [Vroom Boom Boom](item_b016a02c-50bd-4010-91bb-661c1101ade7). If the enemy [D.Va](hero_e8e1dc68-45c4-47c2-b421-95e33594e6b6) is not very aware we can go for  [Impact Burst](item_01fa37d8-4355-4ec2-a9af-59bf030e2882).\n\nSo, how is that [Orisa](hero_91644d44-1093-4f62-ac51-020975465e85) or [Reinhardt](hero_a3b6ca2c-6cbd-43dc-bb78-a728e42fba49) treating you? If your charges are blocked constantly, consider picking [Boost Recycler](item_97a47dab-4554-4340-a9ef-f9424210e08b). Your Charge will most likely be off cooldown before they can counter again. If you are up against [Ana](hero_f1aee6cf-704f-455f-a100-ec882ebbe000) that is good at sleeping you, take [Cushioned Padding](item_20f2f4bc-4611-4d1f-b653-20f04d56b96f) because it basically negates their primary defensive skill.\n\nAnother fun combo is [Magma Strike](item_6d8d893f-d161-4e10-a084-4a5749b12990) combined with [Liquid Nitrogen](item_a8d99526-05a3-4405-babb-b025479b1b98). Especially not-so-mobile characters get slowed inside your lava. It is a worthwhile option, but it may not outweigh your preference for CR with  [Iridescent Iris](item_b7fb28ef-ce82-416b-8693-01c274f8df4e).",
