            "created_at": "2025-08-13T08:20:16.507801+00:00",
            "notes": "Depending on how the match went so far, you either are struggling or came back from 3-0 to 3-3. Anyway, what you want to do here is up to you. Sometimes picking [To Me, My Friends!](item_9bd5bb9d-8026-4092-80c5-21e726c0969f) is very useful - you don't gain more offensive power but you will live a lot longer and your team mates as well. Remember that R7 can be crazy in damage so often you might find yourself better off with some Survival epics.\n\nSome examples:  [Martian Mender](item_0099632b-4e18-450e-844f-22c40e51bc98), [Ogundimu Reduction Field](item_b12daf48-069b-44c1-88fe-221cbcff664d), [Nebula Conduit](item_476b7040-54c9-4f0c-8283-b4407f6809f8) and [Rustung Von Wilhelm](item_aea17a63-3f55-4f91-8f49-a7793fbc56c4). \n\nBut you can also go the full monty with [Blazing Blitz](item_6dd5ba0e-fe32-4128-9f34-4ce8619237b7) and  [Catalytic Crystal](item_3e3f4f77-cdf8-4dda-a5b0-2fb9390aefc4) and hope you can pop off enough ultimates to completely decimate them on the objective. It can be a lot of fun: even if Earthshatter misses, you will still get the Firestrikes. Boom. Boom. Boom. But if you get hindered or stunned, well, good luck with that.",
